Attribution
===========

The GF(2^16) kernels in this package (gf16/*.s, gf16/clmul_arm64.go,
gf16/x86_amd64.go, gf16/affine_*amd64*.go and their generators in
gf16/asmgen/) are Go-assembly ports of the algorithms in ParPar's gf16
library by Anime Tosho (https://github.com/animetosho/ParPar): the CLMul
(NEON/SHA3), Shuffle (SSSE3/AVX2) and Affine2x (GFNI) methods and their
prepared-data layouts. ParPar's sources were distributed under the CC0 1.0
public domain dedication reproduced below; no licence obliges attribution,
but it is given here because the port is derived from that work.

